While speaking on Busted Open Radio, former WWE Women's Champion Jazz revealed that a Hall of Fame induction would be 'a dream' but wants to be inducted whilst she is alive. She said "Of course. That’s everyone’s dream, I would assume, you know? Yeah, I most definitely, I just — all I ask is, if I’m going to receive that honor, I would just like to receive it while I’m still alive. That’s all I ask. Let me be able to walk up and accept that honor."
